 "remarks": "The Key apartments is a newer smoke free community situated directly in the center of Harbor Point's historical Yale and Towne District. The complex is within walking distance to many shops and restaurants and steps from the Stamford train station! The Key apartments promises a distinct urban lifestyle with a resort style heated pool, fire pits, bbq pavillions, state of the art fitness center, dog park, and garage parking. This one bedroom unit is gracefully appointed w/ stainless steel appliances- gas stove, dishwasher, microwave, granite countertops, sunfilled living area w/ sliders to juliette balcony, large bedroom w/ oversized closet, luxurious bathroom, washer/dryer, central air conditioning, gleaming hardwood floors, fresh paint, low security deposit! Walk to train, shops, nightlife! Minutes to highways and beaches! Pet ok-",
